WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.602
-Bebe, you're up first,
so, why don't you come up here

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:03.602
and let's see
what you're gonna play.

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:04.771
Uh, pull the mic down.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:14.280
[ Spins ]

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.283
"Nonsense Karaoke" okay.
-Oh, boy.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.352
-♪ This is Nonsense Karaoke ♪

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:24.023
♪ This is Nonsense Karaoke ♪

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:25.324
-Alright, this one's tricky.

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.293
You're gonna have to sing
a well-known song,

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:30.629
but the lyrics have been
replaced with total nonsense.

00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:32.531
What song will it be?

00:00:32.531 --> 00:00:35.668
-Aah! This is nerve-wracking.
-You can do it.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.070
Well, I think you can.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:39.439
Oh.
-Okay. Okay.

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:42.008
-"Only Girl (In the World),"
but none of those lyrics

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:44.077
will be on the screen,
these are all made-up words.

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:46.078
There's your mic, over there.
-Okay.

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:50.316
-And I installed a, I installed
a Rihanna fan right here

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.385
so that you could get a little
bit of the wind effect.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.554
-[ Laughs ]
-You'll enjoy it.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.554
-Okay. So --
-Bebe Rexha, whenever you're --

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:56.855
-Oh.
-Whenever you're ready.

00:00:56.855 --> 00:00:58.124
-I'm nervous. Okay.
-Don't be.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:00.993
We got you, Bebe.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:02.062
-Ready?
-I don't know.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.329
-Ready, you got this,
you got this.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.331
-I guess so.
-Bebe Rexha, go!

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:09.869
[Intro to Rihanna's "I'm the
Only (Girl In the World)" plays]

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:11.971
-Whoa, alright. Okay.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:14.807 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:19.679
-Lotta wind. Lotta wind.
-Here we go, one, two --

